  "title": "Lasagna Spirals",
  "description": "A creamy mixture of ricotta and mozzarella cheeses, broccoli and green onions is spread on wide lasagna noodles. The noodles are rolled into spirals and baked with spaghetti sauce and Parmesan cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Susan Harshbarger"
  ],
